-- חוזר לבעלויות תש"ע/2: עדכון "תוספת 2008" – השלמה ל-5% (שלב ג') לעובדי
-- הוראה המועסקים בבעלויות החל ממשכורת חודש דצמבר 2009
-- Completing the public-sector raise "tosefet 2008" to 5% (phase C) from the
-- December 2009 salary for teaching staff of the owners' upper secondary
-- schools: the rate, the two shekel additions it updates, who it applies to,
-- the populations whose phase C the 17.6.2009 agreement deferred, and the
-- owners' and the Ministry's duties.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תש"ע/2 עדכון "תוספת 2008" – השלמה ל-5% (שלב ג')`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (15.12.2009), addressee, greeting, subject line and the lead-in naming circulars תשס"ח/4 (the 24.1.08 agreement) and תשס"ט/3 that this one follows; the rules are sections 1–7.

-- Time is counted in school months of 2009/10 (common.l4: September = 1,
-- December = 4); later months continue the count (October 2011 = 26).
`October 2011` MEANS 26

@desc The populations of teaching staff sections 5 and 6 name.
DECLARE `teaching population` IS ONE OF
    @desc employed by an owner (בעלות) in secondary education, in the upper division (חטיבה עליונה)
    `owners' upper-division staff`
    @desc employed in the civil service in official education (kindergartens, primary, middle schools, special education and so on)
    `state-employed staff in official education`
    @desc in recognized unofficial education, in kindergartens, primary schools (networks included) and middle schools
    `recognized unofficial kindergarten, primary and middle-school staff`
    `staff of teacher-training colleges`
    `staff of government secondary schools`
    `other teaching staff`

@desc A teaching employee's salary from December 2009, as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `tosefet employee` HAS
    `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `population`                         IS A `teaching population`
    `combined salary`                    IS A NUMBER @desc the combined salary (השכר המשולב) at its current value, shekels a month
    `tosefet 2001`                       IS A NUMBER @desc tosefet 2001 at its current value, shekels a month

DECLARE `tosefet action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the update` HAS `update paid` IS A NUMBER
    `reimburse the owner for the update`

§§ `1`

-- Section 1 restates section 4 of the collective agreement of 24.1.08: the
-- public-sector raise is completed to 5% from the December 2009 salary,
-- computed on the salary components as they stood in December 2007 (not on
-- the 4% erosion addition paid in January 2008).
@ref akn:art_1
`the rate the agreement completes tosefet 2008 to` MEANS 0.05
`the erosion addition paid in January 2008` MEANS 0.04

§§ `2`

-- Section 2's arithmetic as printed: "5% ÷ 1.04 = 4.81%", the rate on the
-- combined salary and tosefet 2001 at their current value.
@ref akn:art_2
`the rate section 2 prints` MEANS 0.0481

`the rate section 2's division gives` MEANS
    `the rate the agreement completes tosefet 2008 to` DIVIDED BY (1 PLUS `the erosion addition paid in January 2008`)

-- F-2009-10_tasha_02-a: the division gives 4.8077%, not 4.81%.
`section 2's division does not give the rate it prints` MEANS
    NOT (`the rate section 2's division gives` EQUALS `the rate section 2 prints`)
#ASSERT `section 2's division does not give the rate it prints`

-- The reading adopted (F-2009-10_tasha_02-a): the printed 4.81% is the
-- rate the owners apply; it is the one figure the section names as "the
-- rate of the addition".
GIVEN e IS A `tosefet employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the phase C completion` e IS
    IF `this circular applies to` e
    THEN (e's `combined salary` PLUS e's `tosefet 2001`) TIMES `the rate section 2 prints`
    ELSE 0

§§ `3`

@desc A shekel addition section 3 updates, with the amount it stands at from the December 2009 salary.
DECLARE `shekel addition` HAS
    `addition name`          IS A STRING
    `amount from December 2009` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_3
`the updated shekel additions` MEANS
    LIST `shekel addition` "תוספת הסכם תגבור הוראה '94" 147.53,
         `shekel addition` "תוספת הסכם '87" 164.07

GIVEN name IS A STRING
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the updated amount of` name IS
    sum (map (GIVEN a YIELD a's `amount from December 2009`)
             (filter (GIVEN a YIELD a's `addition name` EQUALS name) `the updated shekel additions`))

#ASSERT `the updated amount of` "תוספת הסכם '87" EQUALS 164.07

-- akn:art_4 A pointer: the other rules on tosefet 2008 are in section 4 of circular תשס"ח/4, encoded there; no rule here.

§§ `5`

@ref akn:art_5
GIVEN e IS A `tosefet employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `this circular applies to` e IF
        e's `in the teaching-staff grade`
    AND e's `population` EQUALS `owners' upper-division staff`

§§ `6`

-- Section 6: the agreement of 17.6.2009 ("salary reduction by deferring the
-- update") moves phase C and the two shekel updates from December 2009 to
-- October 2011 for the four populations it lists.
@ref akn:art_6
GIVEN p IS A `teaching population`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `phase C is deferred for` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `state-employed staff in official education` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `recognized unofficial kindergarten, primary and middle-school staff` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `staff of teacher-training colleges` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `staff of government secondary schools` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN p IS A `teaching population`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary month phase C starts in for` p IS
    IF `phase C is deferred for` p
    THEN `October 2011`
    ELSE `month number` December

#ASSERT `the salary month phase C starts in for` `owners' upper-division staff` EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `the salary month phase C starts in for` `staff of teacher-training colleges` EQUALS 26

§§ `7 ביצוע ותשלומים`

@ref akn:art_7/p1
GIVEN e IS A `tosefet employee`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tosefet action`
DECIDE `the owner's update` e IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the update` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the phase C completion` e
    WITHIN `month number` December
    HENCE `the Ministry's reimbursement`
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section 7: the update is made from the December 2009 salary"

-- "בשכל"מ 12/09 המשולם בינואר 2010": the Ministry reimburses the owners in
-- the salary-participation payment for 12/09, paid in January 2010. It
-- follows the owner's December update, so its time runs from that update:
-- one month, December to January.
@ref akn:art_7/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tosefet action`
DECIDE `the Ministry's reimbursement` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owner for the update`
    WITHIN `month number` January MINUS `month number` December
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "section 7: the Ministry reimburses the owners in the salary-participation payment for 12/09, paid in January 2010"

-- akn:art_8 The contact line for questions; no rule.

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and signature; no rule.

-- Worked examples; the salary figures are round placeholders.
`an upper-division teacher` MEANS
    `tosefet employee` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade` IS TRUE
        `population`                  IS `owners' upper-division staff`
        `combined salary`             IS 9000
        `tosefet 2001`                IS 1000

#ASSERT `the phase C completion` `an upper-division teacher` EQUALS 481

-- F-2009-10_tasha_02-a: on 10,000 shekels the two rates differ by 23 agorot.
`the two rates differ on the example` MEANS
    NOT (`the phase C completion` `an upper-division teacher`
         EQUALS 10000 TIMES `the rate section 2's division gives`)
#ASSERT `the two rates differ on the example`

#TRACE `the owner's update` `an upper-division teacher` AT 3 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the update` 481 AT 4
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `reimburse the owner for the update` AT 5
#TRACE `the owner's update` `an upper-division teacher` AT 3 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the update` 481 AT 4
